      "body": "## What\r\n\r\nSkip `test_moss_image_selected_kernel_rejects_mismatched_operands` on ROCm, the same way the other MOSS-Image fused-kernel tests in `test_model_fast_paths.py` are already skipped.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\n\r\n#44325 added this test, and it fails on ROCm in `nightly-test-1-gpu-kernel` on all three MI300 lanes (rocm10, rocm720, rocm724): [run 38779021639](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38779021639/job/116574070249), both params, 2 failed / 46 passed.\r\n\r\nThe test passes mismatched operands and expects a `ValueError` from the input checks in `fused_situ_softcap_mul_bitexact` and `rmsnorm_cast_before_weight_bitexact`. Both kernels are gated on `is_cuda()` (`can_use_fused_situ_softcap_mul`, `can_use_rmsnorm_cast_before_weight`), so on ROCm `_fused_or_native` goes straight to eager. Eager then fails on the shape mismatch with `RuntimeError: The size of tensor a (16) must match the size of tensor b (17)`, which `pytest.raises(ValueError)` doesn't catch.\r\n\r\nThe test is about the selected fused kernel's behaviour, so skipping it where that kernel can't be selected matches the neighbouring `test_moss_image_situ_fusion_is_bit_exact_and_verified` and `test_moss_image_rmsnorm_fusion_is_bit_exact_and_verified`. NVIDIA is unchanged.\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\nROCm, MI300, `nightly-test-1-gpu-kernel` at `aa87e6c59d` with `continue_on_error=false`, 19/19 files pass on both lanes:\r\n- rocm10: [run 39264799995](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39264799995/job/118101481520)\r\n- rocm724: [run 39264805984](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39264805984/job/118101508812)\r\n\r\n`test_model_fast_paths.py`: 46 passed, 69 skipped (2 failing on main, e.g. [nightly 39150288819](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39150288819)). Not run on rocm720, where `test_modulate.py::test_ltx2_ada_values9[True-...]` fails for an unrelated reason. Not run on NVIDIA; the change only adds a ROCm skip.\r\n\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #38822611065](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38822611065)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38822610977](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38822610977)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #38822611294](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38822611294)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\r\n",
